WEBVTT

00:30.180 --> 00:31.320
Are we not done yet?

00:31.320 --> 00:32.770
End this.

00:32.770 --> 00:33.720
Yes, sir.

00:34.990 --> 00:36.720
Third unit, charge!

00:36.720 --> 00:37.680
Advance!

00:50.460 --> 00:52.570
<i>This is progressing
 faster than anticipated.</i>

00:58.360 --> 00:59.290
<i>But...</i>

01:17.970 --> 01:19.420
Master...

02:50.520 --> 02:55.020
<i>The Final Battle at Ivalias</i>

03:09.630 --> 03:11.870
There are too many of them!

03:12.440 --> 03:15.400
Don't let them into the castle! Stop them!

03:20.870 --> 03:21.910
Damn it!

03:21.910 --> 03:24.880
With them so close, I'll hit our allies!

03:24.880 --> 03:26.760
Out of the way!

03:40.570 --> 03:42.480
Follow me!

03:42.480 --> 03:44.030
Murder them all!

03:57.310 --> 03:58.910
Don't let them push you back!

03:58.910 --> 04:02.130
Fight each demon with multiple soldiers!

04:17.330 --> 04:18.940
Second row, ready!

04:20.040 --> 04:21.040
Fire!

04:25.090 --> 04:26.940
Third row, ready!

04:27.950 --> 04:31.000
Retreat! Retreat!

04:34.240 --> 04:35.710
Bye-bye.

04:38.640 --> 04:41.560
What, are we done already?

04:54.540 --> 04:57.640
This war needs to be finished quickly.

04:57.640 --> 05:01.420
We do it fast and clean, and end 
it with a minimum of casualties.

05:04.540 --> 05:08.240
That would be for the best, but...

05:09.700 --> 05:12.840
But what are you planning specifically?

05:13.890 --> 05:15.780
Fight with all your strength.

05:16.910 --> 05:22.290
Hey, are you mocking us just 
because you're Vice-Commander now?

05:22.290 --> 05:23.420
If so...

05:24.000 --> 05:25.100
Beio.

05:25.790 --> 05:27.130
Please, continue.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.390
That's not all, right?

05:29.760 --> 05:30.690
Of course not.

05:38.060 --> 05:40.630
Alchemy. "Demon's Thorns."

05:51.990 --> 05:54.120
Th-The walls sealed up?

05:55.580 --> 06:00.080
If you fight with all your strength, 
how long will you last, Beio-san?

06:01.470 --> 06:06.510
If I keep fighting as hard as 
I can... an hour, I suppose.

06:06.510 --> 06:08.010
That's impressive.

06:08.010 --> 06:12.490
But the rest of your unit 
can't last that long.

06:13.680 --> 06:18.400
Well, half that. No, maybe a little more...

06:18.400 --> 06:20.100
Let's say 10 minutes.

06:20.100 --> 06:24.020
Fight with all your strength for 10 minutes, 
and then withdraw no matter what happens.

06:24.020 --> 06:26.400
Just 10 minutes, right?

06:26.400 --> 06:28.490
I can promise you that!

06:34.020 --> 06:35.980
So far, it's going according to plan.

06:39.160 --> 06:41.830
Now it's our turn!

06:49.600 --> 06:52.260
And I just closed up those walls!

06:53.010 --> 06:59.560
Ike-sama said that part of the plan was that 
our allies wouldn't follow the plan, but...

06:59.850 --> 07:03.600
Crush the humans! No need for mercy!

07:03.600 --> 07:06.320
Smash them with all your might!

07:16.790 --> 07:19.570
Weak! You humans are so weak!

07:20.590 --> 07:24.800
Once Beio-san withdraws, 
we'll have Gamos-san join the fight.

07:24.800 --> 07:29.550
What? You can't trust us? Huh?

07:31.480 --> 07:33.670
I see. I'm starting to understand this.

07:33.670 --> 07:36.720
You want us to work in shifts, 
just like how you fixed the gates.

07:37.120 --> 07:38.850
Correct.

07:40.590 --> 07:43.310
What? Why didn't you just explain?

07:43.770 --> 07:47.040
The longer you fight, 
the more attrition you'll suffer.

07:47.740 --> 07:52.210
Thus, we will attack them in shifts, 
confusing and wearing them down,

07:52.210 --> 07:55.820
while we continue to be able 
to fight at full strength.

07:58.110 --> 07:59.520
I see.

07:59.520 --> 08:01.350
You've thought this through.

08:05.190 --> 08:07.850
<i>Now, what comes next?</i>

08:07.850 --> 08:10.130
<i>Let's see what you've got, Ike.</i>

08:12.090 --> 08:14.260
Die!

08:18.750 --> 08:19.730
Oh, my.

08:19.730 --> 08:23.580
The fight's not over yet. Oink.

08:25.590 --> 08:29.220
But there's tons of them, right?

08:29.220 --> 08:32.150
We can't fight 'em all.

08:32.610 --> 08:38.010
That's why we have Fiorentina's 
alchemist and Jiron's riflemen.

08:38.620 --> 08:44.260
We'll use them to guide them into 
attacking at a single point.

08:45.200 --> 08:48.590
We deliberately leave them
 an opening to attack.

08:48.910 --> 08:52.050
It will be difficult. But can you do it?

08:52.880 --> 08:56.460
Your orders are Cefiro-sama's orders.

08:56.460 --> 08:58.010
I'll do it at the cost of my life.

09:00.640 --> 09:04.560
No. Please do not attempt
to sacrifice your life.

09:07.260 --> 09:13.240
This is something I expect from all of you,
 as well as those you command.

09:13.760 --> 09:20.320
The whole point of ending this quickly 
is to minimize our casualties.

09:20.320 --> 09:22.200
Please don't forget that.

09:22.760 --> 09:23.980
Understood.

09:34.640 --> 09:37.470
Commander! The catapults are ready!

09:38.140 --> 09:42.170
Excellent! Give those monsters hell!

09:50.650 --> 09:52.520
What?

09:58.230 --> 10:00.950
Human weapons are so fragile!

10:09.280 --> 10:11.050
So? What do we do?

10:11.050 --> 10:16.880
The fanged beasts will circle the battlefield,
 attacking catapults and other siege weapons.

10:18.260 --> 10:19.430
Understood.

10:19.640 --> 10:22.640
I've already scouted out the enemy.

10:23.110 --> 10:25.700
Their forces number over 12,000.

10:26.180 --> 10:29.220
And they have reserve forces as well.

10:30.240 --> 10:33.360
Humans are weak, but there are so many of them.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.940
What hole do they crawl out of?

10:35.180 --> 10:38.890
The enemy general is from 
a long family of nobles.

10:38.890 --> 10:44.410
But he's a coward who cares about 
his own safety and well-being first.

10:44.690 --> 10:47.870
I see. So if we defeat him...

10:48.230 --> 10:49.140
Yes.

10:49.140 --> 10:55.250
And if your efforts cause a change in the 
battlefield, the enemy general will act.

10:55.250 --> 10:58.260
That's when we find and capture him.

10:58.260 --> 11:00.850
Will that actually work?

11:00.850 --> 11:04.220
And why capture him? Why not kill him?

11:04.440 --> 11:06.810
Leave that to me.

11:06.810 --> 11:10.190
I'll ask you not to make 
any selfish decisions.

11:21.890 --> 11:24.060
Fine, fine.

11:24.060 --> 11:28.680
So, in short, all we have to do is 
crush the enemy in front of us, right?

11:28.680 --> 11:30.540
That's simple enough.

11:30.990 --> 11:34.420
We'll believe in you, and in the 
commander who believed in you.

11:35.000 --> 11:36.340
Agreed.

11:38.860 --> 11:40.490
Thank you.

11:41.280 --> 11:44.340
Now, let us win this battle!

11:56.170 --> 11:58.230
The fanged beasts are incredibly strong.

11:58.510 --> 12:01.760
So far it's all going according 
to Ike-sama's plans!

12:01.760 --> 12:02.690
Yes.

12:03.290 --> 12:06.250
I hope Cefiro-sama is safe, too.

12:08.260 --> 12:10.790
What will Cefiro-sama be 
doing during this battle?

12:13.940 --> 12:18.240
I've asked her to do something else.

12:18.240 --> 12:22.050
It may be the most important mission of all.

12:30.690 --> 12:32.390
<i>Sheesh.</i>

12:32.390 --> 12:37.840
<i>That Ike, telling me of all 
people to delay their rear forces.</i>

12:37.840 --> 12:39.860
<i>He loves to boss his commander around.</i>

12:47.380 --> 12:50.940
<i>I see someone who looks scrumptious.</i>

13:15.840 --> 13:18.190
H-Hey, what's going on?

13:18.190 --> 13:21.270
We're supposed to outnumber them, right?

13:21.270 --> 13:23.100
That castle's so small.

13:23.100 --> 13:26.700
They were supposed to have 
only a tenth of our forces.

13:27.320 --> 13:31.580
We've broken through part of the 
Ivalias gates and entered the castle,

13:31.580 --> 13:33.010
but the enemy's counterattack

13:33.010 --> 13:35.290
was incredibly powerful and wiped out 
our second and third units.

13:37.770 --> 13:41.210
General, this place is no longer safe. 
You should head back.

13:41.210 --> 13:43.170
Launch an all-out offensive.

13:44.250 --> 13:46.670
But I think we should regroup...

13:46.670 --> 13:48.380
Don't talk back to me.

13:49.420 --> 13:53.600
If we can't beat the demons 
5-on-1, fight them 10-on-1.

13:53.600 --> 13:56.350
And if that's not enough, 20-on-1.

13:56.690 --> 13:58.080
That's...

13:58.080 --> 14:02.710
Think about my position if I can't 
even bring down that tiny castle.

14:03.790 --> 14:05.250
I'm going, too.

14:05.250 --> 14:07.570
That will raise the troops' morale, I'm sure.

14:08.290 --> 14:10.280
Got it? Now, end this.

14:10.800 --> 14:14.390
Everyone, charge! 
The general is going to join us!

14:14.390 --> 14:16.800
Surround and annihilate the enemy!

14:17.470 --> 14:19.710
Charge! Charge!

14:40.810 --> 14:42.670
They keep coming.

14:42.670 --> 14:45.050
Don't these humans feel fear?

14:45.050 --> 14:46.610
They're just fools.

14:46.610 --> 14:49.240
But they keep coming!

14:50.170 --> 14:51.470
I think it's time.

14:56.520 --> 14:57.580
What's this?

15:05.740 --> 15:07.430
H-Help me!

15:10.090 --> 15:12.320
Is this enemy magic?

15:12.320 --> 15:14.550
Where are our mages?

15:15.360 --> 15:18.510
Is that... Did Ike-sama do that?

15:20.010 --> 15:21.560
I don't know what to say.

15:22.690 --> 15:24.790
You did it, kid.

15:28.320 --> 15:30.400
What's going on?

15:33.760 --> 15:34.700
Wait!

15:37.620 --> 15:39.350
You're the commander, aren't you?

15:42.320 --> 15:47.000
My men died trying to pin down your location.

15:47.000 --> 15:48.760
You're going to take responsibility for that.

15:48.760 --> 15:50.560
Y-You bastard...

15:50.560 --> 15:53.980
This battle will end if I kill you.

15:53.980 --> 15:55.960
None of these people care about each other.

15:55.960 --> 15:59.550
They'll place all the 
blame on you and retreat.

16:01.190 --> 16:05.290
However, should you agree to 
retreat now, I will spare you.

16:08.950 --> 16:12.610
But if I die, who'll give the retreat order?

16:12.610 --> 16:14.800
Then we've no choice!

16:39.930 --> 16:41.900
Do you remember me?

16:41.900 --> 16:44.620
Y-You're... the dwarf!

16:46.000 --> 16:48.650
I'm repaying you for that day!

16:51.610 --> 16:53.200
Die!

17:00.070 --> 17:03.330
What are you doing, Ike?
Don't get in my way!

17:07.530 --> 17:11.830
I... I... He...

17:21.450 --> 17:23.050
F-Fine!

17:23.050 --> 17:25.010
D-Don't kill me!

17:25.010 --> 17:27.520
I don't... I don't want to die!

17:27.520 --> 17:30.150
I'll retreat! I'll retreat!

17:30.150 --> 17:32.310
Retreat! Retreat!

17:35.050 --> 17:37.070
But why retreat so suddenly?

17:37.070 --> 17:38.160
I don't know!

17:38.160 --> 17:40.280
Just do as you're told!

17:54.180 --> 17:56.600
He'll come back someday.

17:57.260 --> 17:59.300
I'm grateful to you.

17:59.300 --> 18:05.850
But you'll come to regret 
this choice someday.

18:10.560 --> 18:12.690
<i>Regret, huh?</i>

18:14.710 --> 18:16.010
<i>I don't care.</i>

18:16.470 --> 18:19.580
<i>By then, we'll be much stronger.</i>

18:20.510 --> 18:23.200
We won!

18:26.510 --> 18:27.620
Incredible!

18:27.620 --> 18:30.380
We beat a force ten times our size!

18:30.790 --> 18:33.500
We'll be drinking today, guys!

18:35.700 --> 18:37.300
Bring the booze!

18:39.300 --> 18:41.680
Ike-sama!

18:42.200 --> 18:44.330
I'm so glad! I'm so glad!

18:44.330 --> 18:47.270
Get off me, Jiron! You're crushing me!

18:47.620 --> 18:50.320
That's right! Get off him, pig-face!

18:50.320 --> 18:52.520
That's where I belong!

18:53.320 --> 18:54.470
Get off him!

18:54.470 --> 18:55.440
Get off me!

18:55.440 --> 18:58.740
I'm going to follow him forever!

18:59.560 --> 19:03.700
I can't ignore that!
That's my line!

19:04.640 --> 19:08.630
I treated everybody's injuries, too!

19:08.630 --> 19:10.230
M-Me, too!

19:10.230 --> 19:12.010
You shut up!

19:12.920 --> 19:14.040
Ike-sama!

19:14.040 --> 19:15.880
Are you trying to kill me?!

19:20.230 --> 19:24.080
The commander was right to choose him.

19:24.080 --> 19:25.110
Indeed.

19:25.110 --> 19:29.200
He gave us a place to kick some ass, too.

19:29.200 --> 19:32.480
I'm pretty sure he could've 
done it on his own.

19:32.480 --> 19:36.550
No, before the battle, Ike was saying...

19:36.550 --> 19:41.200
that this crazy plan would only work 
because he had comrades he could trust.

19:42.000 --> 19:43.730
Show off.

19:43.730 --> 19:46.930
And he added this...

19:46.930 --> 19:50.400
That this battle was over before it began.

19:50.400 --> 19:52.790
That all wars were like that.

19:52.790 --> 19:54.800
He's a scary man.

19:54.800 --> 19:55.740
Agreed.

19:55.740 --> 20:00.170
But there's nobody 
I'd rather have as a comrade.

20:00.170 --> 20:01.180
Yes.

20:12.740 --> 20:14.190
Get back.

20:52.160 --> 20:55.290
Retreat! Retreat!

20:56.960 --> 20:58.860
You get to survive.

21:01.300 --> 21:03.560
Some other time, then.

21:19.670 --> 21:21.710
So, he won.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.240
Well done, Ike.

21:24.870 --> 21:26.830
At this rate, it won't be long before...

21:27.450 --> 21:30.380
No, there's no need to hurry.

21:30.380 --> 21:33.140
I'll let the Demon Lord decide.

23:34.140 --> 23:38.850
<i>Negotiations</i>
